nchor at description start prevents all-whitespace bypass; ≥20 chars total. (5) ADOPT-001 §12.8 break-glass procedure — 3-gate playbook (disable via --restore → SHA-pin to last known-good release tag → re-enable after Renovate-bumped fix). All four script components (scaffolder + --restore + --i-understand flag + check-invocation-log-entry.sh covering all four CI behaviours) are hard predecessors for slice 024C. Slice 024B itself ships under documented protocol deviation (direct codex exec / claude -p; non-kernel-dangerous shell + tests + docs scope) per feedback_four_tier_dispatch.md note + justify rule; 024C entry is conditional on FUP-ACC-INSTALL-TARGET-REPO-001 closure (per-repo dispatcher install pattern resolved in ACC).`
